{
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.Blocked": " You absorb the blow."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.ClubTemple": "With a mocking laugh, the gnoll brings her club high and then down in a savage strike that catches you across the temple."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.Dodged": " The gnoll's attack goes wide."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.FootKick": "The gnoll waves her club threateningly, but it's her foot that snaps up from the dusty plain to connect with your gut."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.GutBarge": "With a shudder and lurch, the gnoll barrels forward into your gut, the claws of her free hand raking across your belly."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.JawsUpperArm": "The gnoll leaps forward, her jaws slamming shut across your upper arm. She twists away before you can touch her, laughing the entire time."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.SandAndClub": "The gnoll tumbles to the ground, then comes up with a handful of sand. The sand goes in your face; the club goes into your cheek. Ow."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Attack.TeethScratch": "The hyena girl giggles and darts forward, teeth snapping. Spittle flies everywhere, and the snapping teeth find purchase, drawing red lines across your body."
  "Combat.Gnoll.CameWorms": "[pg]Your foe doesn't seem put off enough to leave..."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Tease.BodySlide": "The gnoll bounds forward, but instead of clobbering you she slides her lithe body against yours. [say: We don't have to fight,] she titters. [say: It's lots easier if I just fuck you.]"
  "Combat.Gnoll.Tease.ClitStroke": "With one hand, the hyena girl grasps her eight-inch clitoris and strokes it. [say: I know you're curious!] she laughs. [say: You want to try this.]"
  "Combat.Gnoll.Tease.HipShake": "The gnoll dances forward, then back, her whole body alive with sensual movement. She catches the way you watch her and smirks, throwing in a hip-shake just for you."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Tease.MuskWave": "The gnoll slides her fingers down the length of her pseudo-penis and collects the cream that drips from its end. With a few steps, she's inside your guard, but all she does is wave her hand in front of your nose. The reek of sex nearly bowls you over."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Tease.Stretch": "The gnoll takes a moment to stretch her sleek, athletic body. Her free hand runs up her side and she leers knowingly at you."
  "Combat.Gnoll.Tease.Taunt": "[say: I love outlanders,] the gnoll confides in you as she circles. [say: You have such interesting cries when you get fucked in a new way.] She laughs, and the sound is far louder than it has any right to be."
}
